#. module: atmta_procurement_core
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:atmta_procurement_core.field_res_company__procurement_qualification_allow_self_approval
msgid ""
"Off by default. Assessing a vendor and approving that assessment are two "
"jobs; this is deliberately separate from the spend self-approval switch "
"because a company may reasonably allow one and not the other."
msgstr ""
"معطل افتراضيًا. تقييم المورد واعتماد ذلك التقييم مهمتان منفصلتان؛ وهذا "
